(7537053, 1205536, 104230, '<td valign="top">I''m not always a fan of water taken with long exposure times, but this slightly lengthened exposure (I''m guessing) enhances the image beautifully. It''s a very pleasing combination of different color palettes. I don''t think this is North Wales, but the image reminds me of hiking there and having the weather deteriorate into something like this quite suddenly.</td>', 'I''m not always a fan of water taken with long exposure times, but this slightly lengthened exposure (I''m guessing) enhances the image beautifully. It''s a very pleasing combination of different color palettes. I don''t think this is North Wales, but the image reminds me of hiking there and having the weather deteriorate into something like this quite suddenly.', '2017-09-28 18:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
