(7537164, 1205570, 142425, '<td valign="top">Lots of positive and encouraging comments, thank you.<br/> <br/>Holy Island is indeed a magical place, we have spent many breaks here over the years and it never lets us down. When the tide comes in and the visitors leave it is the best place in the world to be. <br/> <br/>Home to a large population of seals, oystercatchers, and other seabirds. Oh, and unpredictable weather.</td>', 'Lots of positive and encouraging comments, thank you. Holy Island is indeed a magical place, we have spent many breaks here over the years and it never lets us down. When the tide comes in and the visitors leave it is the best place in the world to be.  Home to a large population of seals, oystercatchers, and other seabirds. Oh, and unpredictable weather.', '2017-09-29 04:11:37.000000', NULL, 0),
